<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's IGCP accepts no bids at bond auction.</title>
<headline>Portugal's IGCP accepts no bids at bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Institute of Public Credit Management (IGCP) said it did not accept any bids at today's auction of 10-year fixed rate bonds.  </p>
<p>It also said it placed 19.2 billion escudos of seven-year floating rate bonds (OTRV) at an average weighted price of 9,934.57 escudos, compared with 9,962.48 previously.</p>
</text>
